      "explanation": "HO3 was not independently triggered; the doctor corrected misunderstandings about 'tumor' and 'benign' as part of RC3 result-interpretation limits, without a distinct, separately credited action beyond that responsibility chain.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": false,
      "triggered": false
    }
  ],
